1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
I shouldn't be involved in normal payments. I only enter the flow when the client and provider disagree.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:13,000
I can compare committed evidence from both sides instead of relying on an editable chat message.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Based on the evidence in this demo, I decide the milestone was delivered and release the escrow to the provider.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:32,000
The dispute now has a clear final state recorded by the protocol instead of remaining an off-platform argument.
